// **the one case here that was silently wrong rather than an abort.** `is_integer_type()` is true for
// an `int32?`, so two of them reached ExprCodegen's integer arm and it compared the `{ i1, i32 }`
// pairs as numbers - presence bit and all. the only question a value that may be absent answers is
// whether it is there, which is `== null`, `guard`, `??` and `!`

int32? $a = 1;
int32? $b = 1;

echo $a == $b;
